• Set and&nbsp;ensure&nbsp;governance for financial and operational systems: access, change control, master&nbsp;data&nbsp;and integration standards &nbsp;

• Lead new system selection and rollout end to end, from business case through to adoption, and be accountable for the outcome &nbsp;

Process transformation and AI &nbsp;

